:: Bailey Orphan Gossip [widget]
<<widget "baileyOrphanGossip">>
	<<if $syndromebaileybuild gte 1 and !$weekly.baileyOrphanGossip>>
		<<set $bailey_gossip_seen to ($bailey_gossip_seen || {})>>
		<<set _pick to "">>

		<<set _once to []>>
		<<if $stockholm_points and $stockholm_points.cafe and !$bailey_gossip_seen.cafe>><<run _once.push("cafe")>><</if>>

		<<if _once.length gt 0>>
			<<set _pick to _once[random(0, _once.length - 1)]>>
			<<set $bailey_gossip_seen[_pick] to true>>
		<<else>>
			<<set _pool to []>>
			<<if $bailey_date_allnight gte 1>><<run _pool.push("allnight")>><</if>>
			<<if $bailey_title_unlocked and $bailey_title isnot "Bailey">><<run _pool.push("title")>><</if>>
			<<if $bailey_desk_offered gte 1>><<run _pool.push("desk")>><</if>>
			<<if $worn.neck.name is "Bailey's collar">><<run _pool.push("collar")>><</if>>
			<<if $baileydefeated gt 1>><<run _pool.push("defeated")>><</if>>
			<<if $baileydefeatedlewd gt 1>><<run _pool.push("defeatedlewd")>><</if>>
			<<if $bailey_date_short gte 1>><<run _pool.push("snitch")>><</if>>
			<<if $bailey_offered gt 1>><<run _pool.push("offered")>><</if>>
			<<if $syndromebailey>><<run _pool.push("generic")>><</if>>

			<<if _pool.length gt 0>>
				<<set _pick to _pool[random(0, _pool.length - 1)]>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>

		<<if _pick isnot "">>
			<<set $weekly.baileyOrphanGossip to true>>
			You see a group of orphans whispering amongst themselves and sneaking glances at you.
			<br><br>
			<<switch _pick>>
				<<case "cafe">>
					"Did you hear?" One of the orphans murmurs, loud enough for you to listen in. "At the Cafe opening, <<pshe stranger>> actually lied that the orphanage is a great place and that Bailey takes care of us."<<hope -1>><<lhope>>
				<<case "allnight">>
					One of the orphans whispers, "I saw Bailey drive <<phim stranger>> to the orphanage early in the morning<<if $bailey_date_allnight gte 2 or $bailey_monogamous>> many times!"<<else>>."<</if>>
				<<case "title">>
					"I heard <<phim stranger>> call Bailey <<baileyTitle>>," says one of the orphans. Another orphan <<print either("gasps", "looks surprised")>>.
				<<case "desk">>
					"Whenever <<pshe stranger>> <<pverb "goes" "go" stranger>> into Bailey's office, <<pshe stranger>> <<pverb "locks" "lock" stranger>> the door and stays in there way too long," murmurs one of the orphans. Another orphan <<print either("giggles", "scoffs")>>.
				<<case "collar">>
					"<<pShes stranger>> wearing that collar with the lotus on it again," whispers one of the orphans. "There's something weird going on between <<phim stranger>> and Bailey, I swear..."
				<<case "defeated">>
					"<<pShe stranger>> beat Bailey up! I saw it!" says one of the orphans, a bit too enthusiastically. Another orphan in the crowd looks <<print either("inspired", "hopeful")>>.<<hope 1>><<ghope>><<reb 1>><<greb>>
				<<case "defeatedlewd">>
					"<<pShe stranger>> made Bailey cum in <<nnpc_his "Bailey">> trousers! No, really! I saw it!" laughs one of the orphans. Another orphan in the crowd <<print either("snickers", "giggles")>>.<<hope 1>><<ghope>><<reb 1>><<greb>>
				<<case "snitch">>
					"Whatever you do, don't talk to <<phim stranger>>," whispers one of the orphans, pointing at you without shame. "<<print either("<<pShes stranger>> in cahoots with Bailey.", "<<pShe stranger>>'ll snitch on you to Bailey.")>>"<<reb -1>><<lreb>>
				<<case "offered">>
					"<<pShes stranger>> a freak. I saw <<phim stranger>> pay Bailey rent and then offer <<pherself stranger>> to be sold anyway," murmurs one of the orphans, pointing right at you. Another orphan looks at you with <<print either("confusion", "pity")>>.<<hope -1>><<lhope>>
				<<case "generic">>
					"<<pShe stranger>> <<pverb "is" "are" stranger>> always <<print either("hanging around", "looking at")>> Bailey," says one of the orphans. "<<print either("What a suck up.", "Looks like Bailey's got a pet.")>>"<<hope -1>><<lhope>>
			<</switch>>
			<br><br>
			One of the orphans makes eye contact with you and looks away. They moved on to gossiping about someone else.
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>


:: Bailey Date Stood Up
<<effects>><<endevent>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

You are in the main hall of the orphanage.
<br><br>

A hand circles your arm. <span class="bailey-red">It's <<baileyTitleNarration>>.</span>
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
	"I waited." <<He>> says flatly. "You didn't show."
<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 30>>
	"You stood me up." <<He>> says calmly. <<His>> jaw is set. "You wasted my time."
<<else>>
	"You wasteful little shit." <<He>> sneers at you. "You stood me up."
<</if>><<npcincr Bailey love -1>><<llove "Bailey">>
<br><br>

<<link [[Apologise|Bailey Date Stood Up Apologise]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Stay silent|Bailey Date Stood Up Silent]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Stood Up Apologise
<<effects>>
<<set $bailey_date_missed to 0>>
<<person1>>

You apologise for standing Bailey up.
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
	<<He>> studies you for a long moment. "Don't let it happen again."
<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 30>>
	<<He>> sneers at you. "Save it. Don't let it happen again."
<<else>>
	"At least you paid for it." <<His>> lip curls. "Don't waste my time again, brat."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> lets go of your arm and stomps away, leaving you alone in the hallway.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Date Stood Up Silent
<<effects>>
<<set $bailey_date_missed to 0>>
<<person1>>

You say nothing.<<npcincr Bailey love -1>><<llove "Bailey">>
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
	The silence stretches. <<He>> lets go of your arm. "Don't let it happen again."
<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 30>>
	<<He>> releases your arm. "Don't waste my time again."
<<else>>
	<<He>> glowers at you. <<He>> slaps you across the face.<<pain 4>><<gpain>><<stress 6>><<gstress>><<trauma 3>><<gtrauma>>
	<br><br>
	<<He>> lets you go. "See what happens next time, damn brat."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Bailey stomps away, leaving you alone in the hallway.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Seen Widget [widget]
<<widget "baileySeenAdd">><<if $baileySeen is undefined>><<set $baileySeen to []>><</if>><<set $baileySeen.pushUnique(_args[0])>><</widget>>

<<widget "homeeventbaileypilled">>
	<<endevent>>
	<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
	<<switch random(1, 3)>>
		<<case 1>>
			Bailey's office door stands ajar. Through the gap you see <<baileyTitleNarration>> standing before the small mirror behind the desk, ledger forgotten under one arm.
			<<He>> turns a little to one side, then the other, studying the unfamiliar body with the same flat, appraising stare <<he>> gives anything that might be worth money.
			<br><br>
			<<His>> eyes find yours in the reflection. "Rent's still due," <<he>> says, without turning around. The door swings shut.
		<<case 2>>
			Bailey stands at the table in the main hall, counting a stack of notes. Halfway through, <<he>> stops.
			<<He>> spreads <<his>> fingers, flexes them, rolls <<his>> shoulders like someone breaking in a new coat. Then <<he>> picks the count back up from exactly where <<he>> left it, faster than before.
			<br><br>
			Whatever conclusions Bailey is drawing about the new body, <<he>> isn't sharing them.
		<<case 3>>
			<<generateyv2>>Up ahead, Bailey stops a <<person2>><<person>> and issues an instruction.
			The voice that comes out isn't the one anyone here grew up fearing, and for a moment the <<person>> just blinks.
			<br><br>
			<<person1>>Bailey pauses, as if weighing the sound of it. Then <<he>> repeats the order, flatter, and the <<person2>><<person>> scrambles to obey.
			<<person1>>Something that isn't quite a smile crosses Bailey's face. The new voice works just fine.
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</widget>>


:: Bailey Kiss Virginity Widget [widget]

/* Bailey taking the PC's first kiss. Elated at Stockholm 3+, mortified otherwise.
Renders nothing if the kiss virginity is already gone. */
<<widget "baileyKissVirginity">>
	<<takeNPCVirginity "Bailey" "kiss" "pc">>
	<<if $player.virginity.kiss is true>>
		<br><br>
		<<if $syndromebaileybuild gte 3>>
			<span class="pink">You feel elated having Bailey take your first kiss.</span><<arousal 500>><<garousal>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="red">You feel mortified having Bailey take your first kiss.</span><<arousal 100>><<garousal>><<stress 6>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<gtrauma>>
		<</if>>
		<<takeVirginity "Bailey" "kiss">>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

/* Bailey taking the PC's first handhold. Elated at Stockholm 1+, mortified otherwise.
Renders nothing if the handholding virginity is already gone.
Call sites own their own spacing. */
/* Pass false where the surrounding passage already takes the virginity itself. */
<<widget "baileyHandholdText">>
	<<set _first to _args[0] isnot false>>
	<<if $syndromebaileybuild gte 1>>
		<span class="lewd">You feel elated holding Bailey's hand<<if _first>> for the first time<</if>>.</span><<arousal 500>><<garousal>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You feel mortified holding Bailey's hand<<if _first>> for the first time<</if>>.</span><<stress 40>><<ggstress>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "baileyHandholdVirginity">>
	<<takeNPCVirginity "Bailey" "handholding" "pc">>
	<<if $player.virginity.handholding is true>>
		<<baileyHandholdText>>
		<<if $worn.hands.name isnot "naked">>
			<span class="blue">Wearing $worn.hands.name, you can't quite feel <<nnpc_his "Bailey">> skin against yours. It doesn't count as your first time.</span>
		<<else>>
			<<takeVirginity "Bailey" "handholding">>
			<<if $innocencestate is 1>>
				<br><br><span class="red">Wait... isn't holding hands how you make babies? A wave of panic washes over you.</span><<stress 25>><<gstress>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>


:: Bailey Brat Tax [widget]

/* Weekly Brat Tax. Accrue with <<baileyBrat N "reason">> */

<<widget "baileyBrat">>
	<<if $bailey_brat is undefined>><<set $bailey_brat to { points: 0, reasons: [] }>><</if>>
	<<set _bratBefore to $bailey_brat.points>>
	<<set $bailey_brat.points to Math.clamp($bailey_brat.points + _args[0], 0, 20)>>
	<<run $bailey_brat.reasons.pushUnique(_args[1])>>
	<<set _bratGained to ($bailey_brat.points - _bratBefore) * Math.floor($rentmoney / 10)>>
	<<gbrattax _bratGained>>
<</widget>>

/* $bratTax = points * 1/10 of current rent. Call beside <<babyRent>>. */
<<widget "bratTaxCalc">>
	<<set $bratTax to (($bailey_brat and $bailey_brat.points) || 0) * Math.floor($rentmoney / 10)>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "baileyOfferSettleRent">>
	/* Recompute rather than trusting $bratTax: not every path in announces the tax first. */
	<<bratTaxCalc>>
	<<set _offerRentDue to $rentmoney + ($babyRent or 0) + ($bratTax or 0)>>
	/* Pockets short but savings can cover it: Bailey marches the player to the bank, same as <<rentpay>>. */
	<<set _offerCashBefore to $money>>
	<<if $money lt _offerRentDue>><<baileyBankDraw `_offerRentDue - $money`>><</if>>
	/* <<baileyBankDraw>> prints a scene of its own when it withdraws, so keep it off the next paragraph. */
	<<if $money gt _offerCashBefore>><br><br><</if>>
	<<set _offerRentPaid to $money gte _offerRentDue>>
	<<if _offerRentPaid>>
		<<money `-_offerRentDue` "baileyRent">>
	<</if>>
	<<set $bailey_brat to { points: 0, reasons: [] }>><<set $bratTax to 0>>
	<<set $baileydefeatedchain to 0>>
	/* Only wipe the arrears if the money actually changed hands. */
	<<if _offerRentPaid>>
		<<set $baileyRefusedToPay to 0>>
		<<set $baileyRefusedToPayTotal to $baileyRefusedToPayTotal lt _offerRentDue ? 0 : $baileyRefusedToPayTotal - _offerRentDue>>
	<</if>>
	<<unset $bailey_encroach>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "bratReasonList">>
	<<set _phrases to ($bailey_brat ? $bailey_brat.reasons : []).map(function (r) {
		var him = C.npc.Bailey.pronoun === "m" ? "him" : "her";
		var his = C.npc.Bailey.pronoun === "m" ? "his" : "her";
		switch (r) {
			case "papers":  return "you tried to lift your identification papers";
			case "bill":    return "you made " + him + " cover dinner";
			case "chair":   return "you got caught masturbating in " + his + " chair";
			case "whitney_desk": return "you fooled around with Whitney on " + his + " desk";
			case "stoodup": return "you stood Bailey up after asking " + him + " on a date";
			case "gala_steal": return "you got caught stealing at " + his + " gala";
			case "gala_scene": return "you made a scene at " + his + " gala";
			case "seducebeat": return "you beat Bailey up after seducing " + him;
			case "vent_blame": return "you blamed " + him + " for your problems";
			case "vent_fight": return "you beat " + him + " up and ran out on " + him;
			default:        return r;
		}
	})>>
	<<print formatList(_phrases, "and")>>
<</widget>>

:: Bailey Combat Widgets [widget]

<<widget "bodywriting_npc_bailey">>
	<<if $npc.includes("Bailey") and $NPCList and $NPCList[0] and $NPCList[0].fullDescription>>
		<<set $_text_output to "">>
		<<set _bwEntry to $skin[_args[0]]>>
		<<set _bwOwner to (_bwEntry && _bwEntry.owner) ? _bwEntry.owner : "">>
		<<if !_bwOwner>>
			<<set _bwExisting to Object.values($skin).find(s => s && s.owner === "Bailey")>>
			<<if _bwExisting and !(_bwExisting.writing and _bwExisting.writing.startsWith("£"))>>
				<<set _bwOwner to "Bailey">>
				<<set _bwEntry to _bwExisting>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>

		<<if _bwOwner is "Bailey">>
			<<if $syndromebailey>><<set $_text_output to `<<He>> has a fierce look in <<his>> eyes. "That's right. Mine."`>>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>><<set $_strings to [
					`<<He>> snarls. "Who else has seen that?"`,
					`<<He>> growls. "<<goodGirl>>."`,
					`<<His>> eyes burn. "Mine."`,
				]>><<set $_text_output to $_strings[random(0, $_strings.length - 1)]>>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>><<set $_text_output to `<<He>> scoffs. "Don't you forget it."`>>
			<<else>><<set $_strings to [
					`<<He>> murmurs. "Right where you belong."`,
					`<<He>> thumbs it. "Don't wash that off."`,
					`<<He>> says nothing. <<He>> looks satisfied.`,
					`<<He>> exhales. "So you do know who you belong to."`,
				]>><<set $_text_output to $_strings[random(0, $_strings.length - 1)]>>
			<</if>>

		<<elseif _bwOwner is "Robin">>
			<<if $syndromebailey>>
				<<set $_text_output to `<<His>> eyes darken. "Maybe I should sell <<nnpc_him "Robin">> somewhere you can't find <<nnpc_him "Robin">>."`>>
			<<else>>
				<<set $_strings to [
					`<<He>> sneers. "That worthless brat can't save you."`,
					`<<He>> snickers. "Good thinking. They'll pay double for a package deal."`,
					`<<He>> snickers. "Keep bringing <<nnpc_him "Robin">> around. I'll find a use for <<nnpc_him "Robin">> too."`,
				]>>
				<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
					<<run $_strings.push(`<<He>> sneers. "Useless. Both of you."`)>>
				<</if>>
				<<set $_text_output to $_strings[random(0, $_strings.length - 1)]>>
			<</if>>

		<<elseif _bwOwner is "Eden">>
			<<if $syndromebailey>>
				<<set $_strings to [
					`<<He>> growls, gripping the mark hard enough to hurt. "Get <<nnpc_his "Eden">> name off of you."`,
					`<<He>> traces Eden's mark with <<his>> thumb. Slowly. Then <<his>> nail digs in. "Get rid of it."`,
				]>>
				<<set $_text_output to $_strings[random(0, $_strings.length - 1)]>>
			<<else>>
				<<set $_strings to [
					`<<He>> snarls. "<<nnpc_He "Eden">> chose the trees over people. Over you. Over everyone."`,
					`<<His>> fingers close around the marked skin. "<<nnpc_He "Eden">> doesn't get to keep anything."`,
				]>>
				<<set $_text_output to $_strings[random(0, $_strings.length - 1)]>>
			<</if>>

		<<elseif _bwOwner is "Sydney">>
			<<set $_text_output to `<<He>> sneers. "Your little saint isn't here."`>>

		<<elseif _bwOwner is "Avery">>
			<<if $avery_mansion>>
				<<set $_text_output to `<<He>> smirks. "<<nnpc_He "Avery">> paid and still needs to write <<nnpc_his "Avery">> name on it?"`>>
			<<else>>
				<<set $_text_output to `<<His>> lip curls. <<His>> fingers dig painfully into the mark.`>>
			<</if>>

		<<elseif _bwOwner is "Alex">>
			<<set $_text_output to `<<He>> scoffs. "That idiot farmer? At least cattle know their place."`>>

		<<elseif _bwOwner is "Whitney">>
			<<set $_strings to [
				`<<He>> snickers. "I'll let <<nnpc_him "Whitney">> keep pretending."`,
				`<<He>> exhales. "That brat can't afford you."`,
			]>>
			<<set $_text_output to $_strings[random(0, $_strings.length - 1)]>>

		<<elseif _bwOwner is "Kylar">>
			<<set $_text_output to `<<He>> reads it. "Obsessive little shit."`>>

		<<elseif _bwOwner is "Remy">>
			<<set $_text_output to `<<He>> sneers at the mark with disgust. "Looks like Remy got <<nnpc_his "Remy">> money's worth."`>>

		<<elseif _bwOwner is "Gwylan">>
			<<set $_text_output to `<<He>> traces the mark. "<<nnpc_He "Gwylan">> can take what <<nnpc_he "Gwylan">> wants from your head. I'll take what I want from the rest of you."`>>

		<<elseif _bwOwner is "rape">>
			<<set $_strings to [
				`<<He>> curls <<his>> lip. "What a waste."`,
				`<<He>> curls <<his>> lip. "Throwing your body away like garbage. Pathetic."`,
			]>>
			<<set $_text_output to $_strings[random(0, $_strings.length - 1)]>>

		<<elseif _bwOwner is "prostitution">>
			<<set _bp_looks     to (Math.min($beauty || 0, $beautymax || 10000) / ($beautymax || 10000) + Math.min($allure || 0, 8000) / 8000) / 2>>
			<<set _bp_seduction to Math.min($seductionskill || 0, 10000) / 10000>>
			<<set _bp_physique  to Math.min($physique || 0, $physiquesize || 12000) / ($physiquesize || 12000)>>
			<<set _bp_school    to Math.min(($maths||0)+($english||0)+($science||0)+($history||0), 4000) / 4000>>
			<<set _bp_skuld     to Math.min($skulduggery || 0, 1000) / 1000>>
			<<set _bp_raw to (_bp_looks*3000) + (_bp_seduction*2000) + (_bp_physique*1000) + (_bp_school*500) + (_bp_skuld*500)>>
			<<set _baileyPrice to Math.max(5, Math.min(1000, Math.floor((_bp_raw / 7000) * 1000 / 5) * 5))>>
			<<set _oldDegree to _bwEntry.degree || 0>>
			<<add_bodywriting _args[0] "baileys_asset" _args[1]>>
			<<set $skin[_args[0]].writing to "£" + _baileyPrice>>
			<<set $skin[_args[0]].degree to _baileyPrice * 10>>
			<<if $syndromebailey>>
				<<set $skin[_args[0]].special to "prostitution">>
			<</if>>
			<<bodywriting_finalisation _args[0]>>
			<<if (_baileyPrice * 10) gt _oldDegree>>
				<<set $_strings to [
					`<<He>> scoffs at the old price and scratches it out. "Wrong." <<He>> writes a new number. "You're worth more than that."`,
					`<<He>> crosses out the mark. "Whoever wrote that doesn't know what they have." <<He>> writes <<his>> own price.`,
				]>>
			<<elseif (_baileyPrice * 10) lt _oldDegree>>
				<<set $_strings to [
					`<<He>> sneers at the number. "Overpaying." <<He>> scratches it out and writes a lower one.`,
					`<<He>> crosses out the mark with a scoff. "Flattering yourself." <<He>> writes <<his>> own appraisal.`,
				]>>
			<<else>>
				<<set $_strings to [
					`<<He>> reads the old price. <<He>> crosses it out anyway and writes the same number in <<his>> own hand.`,
				]>>
			<</if>>
			<<set $_text_output to $_strings[random(0, $_strings.length - 1)]>>

		<<elseif _bwEntry && _bwEntry.owner>>
			<<set $_strings to [
				`<<He>> eyes it. "If they cared, they'd have paid for you."`,
				`<<He>> glances at it, then at you. "Cheap."`,
				`<<He>> looks unimpressed. "That cost them nothing."`,
			]>>
			<<set $_text_output to $_strings[random(0, $_strings.length - 1)]>>

		<</if>>

		<<if $_text_output>>
			<<print $_text_output>>
		<<else>>
			/* PC is unmarked, so Bailey writes a price tag based on their stats. */
			<<set _bp_looks     to (Math.min($beauty || 0, $beautymax || 10000) / ($beautymax || 10000) + Math.min($allure || 0, 8000) / 8000) / 2>>
			<<set _bp_seduction to Math.min($seductionskill || 0, 10000) / 10000>>
			<<set _bp_physique  to Math.min($physique || 0, $physiquesize || 12000) / ($physiquesize || 12000)>>
			<<set _bp_school    to Math.min(($maths||0)+($english||0)+($science||0)+($history||0), 4000) / 4000>>
			<<set _bp_skuld     to Math.min($skulduggery || 0, 1000) / 1000>>
			<<set _bp_raw to (_bp_looks*3000) + (_bp_seduction*2000) + (_bp_physique*1000) + (_bp_school*500) + (_bp_skuld*500)>>
			<<set _baileyPrice to Math.max(5, Math.min(1000, Math.floor((_bp_raw / 7000) * 1000 / 5) * 5))>>
			<<add_bodywriting _args[0] "baileys_asset" _args[1]>>
			<<set $skin[_args[0]].writing to "£" + _baileyPrice>>
			<<set $skin[_args[0]].degree to _baileyPrice * 10>>
			<<if $syndromebailey>>
				<<set $skin[_args[0]].special to "prostitution">>
			<</if>>
			<<bodywriting_finalisation _args[0]>>
			<<if _baileyPrice gte 800>><<set $_strings to [
					`"Good." <<He>> looks satisfied.`,
					`"You lived up to your potential." <<He>> looks satisfied.`,
				]>><<print $_strings[random(0, $_strings.length - 1)]>>
			<<elseif _baileyPrice gte 500>><<set $_strings to [
					`"Not bad," <<he>> says. "For now."`,
					`"Could be worse."`,
					`"Still room to grow."`,
				]>><<print $_strings[random(0, $_strings.length - 1)]>>
			<<elseif _baileyPrice gte 200>><<set $_strings to [
					`<<He>> shrugs. "I've sold cheaper."`,
					`"Middling."`,
				]>><<print $_strings[random(0, $_strings.length - 1)]>>
			<<else>><<if C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>"Worthless." <<He>> caps the pen.<<else>>"Disappointing." <<He>> caps the pen.<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>


:: Bailey TF Reaction [widget]
<<widget "baileyTF">>
	<<if $weekly.baileyTFseen isnot true and random(1,5) is 1>><<set $weekly.baileyTFseen to true>>
		<<if $NPCList[0] and $NPCList[0].fullDescription is "Bailey">><<person1>><<else>><<endevent>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>><<set _baileyTFOwnsSlot to true>><</if>>
		<<if Transformations.chimeraFull("melusine")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stops walking. <<His>> eyes move over your horns, your wings, the light at your head. <<He>> takes a slow breath through <<his>> nose. "I've been doing this twenty years and I've never seen one of you." <<He>> steps around you without touching you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stops walking and stares. <<His>> mouth opens, then closes. <<He>> takes a wide path around you and doesn't look back.
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stops mid-stride and looks at you for a long moment. "I don't know what to do with that," <<he>> says. <<He>> walks around you.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.chimeraFull("ryuujin")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze moves from your horns to your halo. "Dragon and angel," <<he>> says. "Someone would pay for either. Both is greedy." <<He>> shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks at your horns, then your halo, and shakes <<his>> head. "Pick one." <<He>> bumps past you.
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes move between your horns and your halo. <<He>> says nothing and walks past, closer than <<he>> needs to.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.chimeraFull("bakunawa")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze settles on your horns. <<He>> reaches up and runs a thumb along one. "Dragon and demon. That's a short list of buyers, and all of them pay well." <<He>> lets go and shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks at your horns and your tail and steps back. "Stay away from me." <<He>> keeps to the far wall as <<he>> passes.
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks at your horns for a long moment. <<His>> jaw tightens. <<He>> bumps past you without a word.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.chimeraFull("seraphim")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze runs the length of your wings, all of them. <<He>> straightens a feather with two fingers. "That's more than anyone needs." <<He>> shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stares at your wings. "You'll knock something over." <<He>> shoves past you and clips a wing with <<his>> shoulder.<<gpain>><<pain 4>>
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks at your wings and stops. <<He>> counts them, then keeps walking, bumping your shoulder as <<he>> goes.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.chimeraFull("kitsune")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze moves along your tails, one by one. "Foxes," <<he>> says. "And now there's more of you." <<He>> shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks at your tails and <<his>> lip curls. "One was already too many." <<He>> bumps past you.
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stops to look at your tails. <<He>> exhales sharply and keeps walking, bumping past you.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.chimeraFull("okami")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes move from your wolf ears to your wings. <<He>> reaches out and tilts your head to the side, examining one ear. "You've been busy." <<He>> lets go and shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks at your ears, then your wings. "A stray with wings is still a stray." <<He>> brushes past you.
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks at your ears and your wings. <<His>> expression stays flat. <<He>> bumps your shoulder as <<he>> passes.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.partActive("waterdragon", "horns") or Transformations.partActive("waterdragon", "tail")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes stop on your horns. <<He>> takes one between two fingers and turns your head to catch the light. "There's a man at the docks who asks after things like you." <<He>> lets go and shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> glances at your horns and sneers. "Watch where you point those." <<He>> shoulders past you.
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks at your horns. "Don't scratch the walls," <<he>> says. <<He>> bumps past you.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.partActive("wolf", "ears") and Transformations.partActive("wolf", "tail")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> stare lingers on your wolf ears. <<He>> reaches out and tilts your head to the side, examining one. <<He>> lets out an appraising hum before <<he>> lets go and shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stares at your wolf ears. <<He>> flicks one with <<his>> finger. "You look like a stray." <<He>> brushes past you.
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stops to run two fingers along one of your wolf ears. <<He>> lets out an appraising hum before <<he>> lets go, bumping past your shoulder as <<he>> leaves.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.partActive("cat", "ears") and Transformations.partActive("cat", "tail")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> watches your feline tail flick behind you, expression unreadable. "Fitting. You do always land on your feet." <<He>> brushes past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> grabs your feline tail and yanks it full force. <<He>> lets go and shoulders past you, wiping <<his>> hand on <<his>> trousers as <<he>> leaves.<<gpain>><<pain 4>>
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> watches your feline tail flick. "I know someone who would pay good money for a pussycat." <<He>> shoulders past you.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.partActive("cow", "ears") and Transformations.partActive("cow", "tail") and Transformations.partActive("cow", "horns")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze travels from your cow horns to your cow tail. "Cows are in demand. Lucky you." <<He>> brushes past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> glances at your cow horns and sneers. "Pathetic." <<He>> bumps past you.
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stares at your cow tail with a sneer. <<He>> bumps your shoulder as <<he>> passes through.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.partActive("bird", "wings") and Transformations.partActive("bird", "tail") and Transformations.partActive("bird", "plumage")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze follows the line of your wings. <<He>> straightens a crooked feather. "Someone's going to try to cage you." <<He>> shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> plucks a loose feather from your shoulder and inspects it before dropping it on the floor. "Pick that up." <<He>> shoulders past you down the hall.
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stops to run a finger along a feather. <<His>> expression stays flat. "Careful. Someone might want to clip them." <<He>> bumps your shoulder as <<he>> passes.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.partActive("fox", "ears") and Transformations.partActive("fox", "tail")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stares at your fox ears, then at you. Something flickers behind <<his>> eyes. "Foxes," <<he>> sneers. "I've had my fill of foxes." <<He>> shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> lip curls at the sight of your fox ears. "Great. Another one." <<He>> bumps past you.
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks at your fox ears and stops mid-stride. <<He>> exhales sharply and keeps walking, bumping past you.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.partActive("bear", "ears") and Transformations.partActive("bear", "tail")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze moves over your bear ears and stops on your shoulders. <<He>> steps around you instead of through you, for once. "Don't get any ideas." <<He>> keeps walking.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks at your bear ears. "You eat enough as it is." <<He>> shoulders past you.
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks at your bear ears, then at the doorframe behind you. <<He>> says nothing and bumps past you.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.partActive("bunny", "ears") and Transformations.partActive("bunny", "tail")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes find your rabbit ears. <<He>> takes one and folds it down flat against your head, then lets it spring back up. "Cheap costume, expensive tastes." <<He>> shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> grabs one of your rabbit ears and pulls until you follow <<his>> hand down. "Rabbits get eaten." <<He>> lets go and bumps past you.<<gpain>><<pain 4>>
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks at your rabbit ears. "Breed like one and you're out," <<he>> says. <<He>> bumps your shoulder as <<he>> passes.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.partActive("fallenAngel", "wings")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze traces your darkened wings. <<He>> runs a thumb along one blackened feather, slow and deliberate. "Damaged goods sell at a discount." <<He>> lets the feather go. "Unless you know the right buyer." <<He>> shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> lip curls at your darkened wings. "You had one thing going for you." <<He>> flicks a blackened feather off your shoulder. "Not anymore." <<He>> shoulders past you.
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes move from your wings to your halo. <<He>> stares at the dim glow for a long moment, <<his>> expression stiff. "Stupid little shit." <<He>> bumps past you.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.partActive("angel", "wings") and Transformations.partActive("angel", "halo")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> regards your halo, then your wings. <<He>> straightens your feathers with two fingers. "You'll draw attention." <<He>> shoulders past.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes move from your halo to your wings. <<He>> scowls at them before bumping past you down the hallway.
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> shoots a glare at your halo. "Take that off. You look ridiculous." <<He>> bumps past you.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif Transformations.partActive("demon", "horns")>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze settles on your horns. <<He>> reaches up and taps one with <<his>> knuckle. "Fitting." <<He>> drops <<his>> hand and shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes flick to your horns with a sneer. "Seems about right." <<He>> shoulders past you.
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes flick to your horns. <<His>> mouth twitches. "Suits you." <<He>> brushes past you.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif $worn.neck.name is "Bailey's collar">>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes find your collar. <<He>> wraps <<his>> hand around your neck like a second collar, smiling. "Good. Don't lose it." <<He>> lets you go and bumps past you.
			<br><br>

		<<elseif $worn.neck.collared is 1>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes find the leash. <<He>> holds your stare for a long moment, expression flat. <<He>> reaches up and runs <<his>> hand along your collar. "Someone thinks they own you." <<He>> bumps past you as <<he>> leaves.
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze drops to the leash. <<He>> grabs it, winds it once around <<his>> fist, and gives it a sharp tug, causing you to stumble forward. "Someone already broke you in. Good." <<He>> lets go of the leash and bumps past you.<<gpain>><<pain 4>>
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes drop to the leash. <<He>> reaches for it and tugs you towards <<him>>, causing you to stumble. Then, <<he>> lets go and bumps past you.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif $beauty gte ($beautymax * 0.8)>>
			<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze runs over you, slow and deliberate. "Valuable, aren't you?" <<he>> says, before <<he>> bumps past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks you over. "You clean up well. Might get more out of you yet." <<He>> shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<<else>>
				Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes linger on you. <<His>> jaw tightens before <<he>> shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<else>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks you over once, says nothing, and bumps your shoulder as <<he>> passes.
			<br><br>

		<</if>>
		<<if _baileyTFOwnsSlot>><<endevent>><</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>
